/-!
# Broad arithmetic frames

The broad Frobenius existence assertion is recorded as `BroadArithmeticFrameExistence`.
From such a frame, the construction below produces the ramified formal fundamental matrix
and its genuine numerical evaluation. The base is enlarged to include the ramified
coordinate and the logarithm. The logarithmic matrix factor is a unit over that base.
-/

open scoped BigOperators Matrix

noncomputable section

set_option maxHeartbeats 400000
